                "img": "https://arxiv.org/html/2611.04467/2611.04467v1/figures/assets/uubench_dataset_overview.png",
                "caption": "Figure 2:Overview ofUUBench. The benchmark covers 30 target\nconcepts across characters, landmarks, and objects, together with\n60 neighboring concepts and 720 reference images in total.\nWe evaluate forgetting, capability preservation, and robustness\nto perturbations in both generation and visual understanding.\nUnified Forget and Unified Strict Forget measure joint success\nacross pathways.",
